      "problem": "The vector $\\overset{\\to }{UV}$ has magnitude $\\frac{1}{3}.$ Which of the following is a unit vector that is parallel to $\\overset{\\to }{UV}?$",
      "worked_solution": "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $\\overset{\\to }{UV},$ we divide $\\overset{\\to }{UV}$ by its length:\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{\\overset{\\to }{UV}}{|\\overset{\\to }{UV}|}=\\frac{1}{(\\frac{1}{3})}\\overset{\\to }{UV}=3\\overset{\\to }{UV}\n$$",
